
(Feidhm nua: ['List by: 0.']) tosaigh.
>> x := Feidhm nua: ['Out write: \['hello there\'], stop.'].
x tosaigh.
Aschur scríobh: ['+ 3 to Number gives: ? '] ? (Uimhir + 3), líne-nua.
Aschur scríobh: ['Adding 3 to Number gives: ? '] ? (Uimhir suimigh: 3), líne-nua.
Aschur scríobh: (['Appending something to String gives: [this]'] [this]: (Teaghrán iarcheangail: ['something'])), líne-nua.
